{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "9: Dashboard analytics",
  "description": "End-to-end: how the Overview page turns stored aggregate buckets into KPIs and charts, including an approximate P95 reconstructed from fixed-bound histograms. Every step embeds the numbered sequence diagram and points at the exact code for that step.",
  "nextTour": "10: Context-insights sync",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Step 1 — Open the Overview",
      "file": "src/dashboard/AgentObservability.Dashboard/Pages/Index.razor",
      "line": 1,
      "description": "![9: Dashboard analytics](.tours/diagrams/d-62.svg)\n\n**▶ Step 1 of 8 in the sequence diagram — `Viewer → Index.razor: Open dashboard \"/\"`**\n\nOpening the dashboard root (`/`) renders the Overview page — a Blazor Server component that pulls metrics on init and every 60 seconds."
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 2 — Ask for metrics",
      "file": "src/dashboard/AgentObservability.Dashboard/Pages/Index.razor",
      "line": 104,
      "description": "![9: Dashboard analytics](.tours/diagrams/d-63.svg)\n\n**▶ Step 2 of 8 in the sequence diagram — `Index.razor → AggregateAnalyticsService: GetDashboardMetricsAsync(24h)`**\n\n`LoadAsync` calls `Analytics.GetDashboardMetricsAsync(24h)`. The page holds no data of its own — it asks the analytics service for a ready-to-render DTO."
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 3 — Query the org's buckets",
      "file": "src/dashboard/AgentObservability.Dashboard/Services/Ingestion/TableAggregateStore.cs",
      "line": 46,
      "description": "![9: Dashboard analytics](.tours/diagrams/d-64.svg)\n\n**▶ Step 3 of 8 in the sequence diagram — `AggregateAnalyticsService → TableAggregateStore: QueryBucketsAsync(range)`**\n\nThe service reads the org's buckets for the window via `QueryBucketsAsync(orgId, from, to)`. Only aggregate buckets exist in storage — there is no raw content to read."
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 4 — Aggregate the buckets",
      "file": "src/dashboard/AgentObservability.Dashboard/Services/Analytics/AggregateAnalyticsService.cs",
      "line": 51,
      "description": "![9: Dashboard analytics](.tours/diagrams/d-65.svg)\n\n**▶ Step 4 of 8 in the sequence diagram — `TableAggregateStore → AggregateAnalyticsService: aggregate buckets`**\n\n`GetDashboardMetricsAsync` filters out unknown-repo buckets, then sums interaction counts and durations and counts distinct repos/developers — reproducing the legacy overview semantics over buckets."
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 5 — Approximate P95 from histograms",
      "file": "src/dashboard/AgentObservability.Dashboard/Services/Analytics/AggregateAnalyticsService.cs",
      "line": 96,
      "description": "![9: Dashboard analytics](.tours/diagrams/d-66.svg)\n\n**▶ Step 5 of 8 in the sequence diagram — `AggregateAnalyticsService → AggregateAnalyticsService: MergeHistogram + ApproximateP95`**\n\nP95 latency is `ApproximateP95(MergeHistogram(...))`: fixed-bound histograms are summed element-wise across buckets, then the 0.95 crossing bound is read off. Approximate by construction — raw latencies were never shipped."
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 6 — Pack the DTO",
      "file": "src/dashboard/AgentObservability.Dashboard/Services/Analytics/AggregateAnalyticsService.cs",
      "line": 92,
      "description": "![9: Dashboard analytics](.tours/diagrams/d-67.svg)\n\n**▶ Step 6 of 8 in the sequence diagram — `AggregateAnalyticsService → Index.razor: DashboardMetrics`**\n\nThe results are packed into a `DashboardMetrics` DTO — totals, averages, P95, active repos/devs, request-volume series, and model breakdown — and returned to the page."
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 7 — Bind the series",
      "file": "src/dashboard/AgentObservability.Dashboard/Pages/Index.razor",
      "line": 56,
      "description": "![9: Dashboard analytics](.tours/diagrams/d-68.svg)\n\n**▶ Step 7 of 8 in the sequence diagram — `Index.razor → Radzen charts: bind series`**\n\nThe page binds the series to Radzen charts, e.g. `RadzenColumnSeries Data=@metrics.RequestVolume`."
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 8 — Render, then poll",
      "file": "src/dashboard/AgentObservability.Dashboard/Pages/Index.razor",
      "line": 23,
      "description": "![9: Dashboard analytics](.tours/diagrams/d-69.svg)\n\n**▶ Step 8 of 8 in the sequence diagram — `Radzen charts → Viewer: rendered charts`**\n\nOnce `metrics` is non-null, the metric cards and charts render. A 60-second `PeriodicTimer` re-runs `LoadAsync`, so the Overview stays current without a manual refresh."
    }
  ]
}
